#: templates/index.html
msgid ""
"Your password derives half the key in the browser via PBKDF2 — 600,000 "
"iterations — and never leaves the device. The other half is a server-held"
" share released exactly once, so a stolen ciphertext alone is dead bytes."
" Buzzdrop stores ciphertext and metadata; it cannot read the drop."
msgstr ""

